  ('ischgl-austria', '01F', 'Ischgl', 'Austria', '239 km across two countries, a mountain that throws', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'Austria', '{"ski","entertainment","adventure","wellness","culinary","family"}', '{"alpine","festive","dramatic"}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Silvretta Arena = cross-border Ischgl (AT) - Samnaun (CH, duty-free): 239 km pistes + 15 km ski routes, 45 lifts, base ~1,360-1,377 m to 2,872 m (Palinkopf/Greitspitze), ~1,512 m vertical","Piste split ~21% easy / 58% intermediate / 21% difficult; season ~27 Nov 2025 - 3 May 2026 (high, snow-sure)","Idalp = mid-mountain hub (lifts, restaurants, concert stage); ski across the border to duty-free Samnaun and back","Top of the Mountain concerts = stadium-scale acts on the mountain to open + close the season (artists/dates to verify)","Legendary apres/nightlife: Kitzloch + Niki''s Stadl confirmed (Pacha/Kuhstall/Trofana Alm unverified)","Silvretta Arena VIP Skipass (EUR, covers both countries; prices to verify); no Ikon/Epic affiliation found","Hotel Trofana Royal = 5-star superior (Michelin Key 2026); Paznaunerstube (chef Martin Sieberer) Michelin-recognised + 4 G&M toques/18 pts (Michelin cross-check flagged); ~2,500 m2 spa (Falstaff 98/100)","Silvretta Therme Ischgl = modern village thermal-spa complex (opening year/size to verify)","Reached Innsbruck ~70 min / Zurich-Munich <3 hr; rail to Landeck-Zams then Paznaun bus","Heli-skiing NOT available at Ischgl - Austria permits it only at designated Vorarlberg (Lech-Zurs) sites, not Tirol/Paznaun","Big vertical ~1,512 m from 2,872 m to the village; 45-lift high-capacity network moves the winter crowds","Trofana Royal fields a 2nd gourmet room - Heimatbuehne (3 Gault&Millau toques / 16 pts) - beyond the Paznaunerstube","Cross-border avalanche: ski the Lawinenwarndienst Tirol bulletin for the Austrian side, SLF (Switzerland) for the Samnaun side","A rare four-in-one day: ski to duty-free Switzerland, shop, ski home, catch a mountain concert, close the night in the village"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 EU general / 140 Bergrettung alpine rescue / 144 ambulance / 133 police / 122 fire","hospital":"district hospital in the Landeck/Zams area (a.oe. Krankenhaus St. Vinzenz Zams) down-valley; 140 Bergrettung / helicopter alpine evac","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"High-alpine off-piste + 15 km ski routes - avalanche is the killer: Lawinenwarndienst Tirol via Euregio lawinen.report, EAWS 5-level scale; transceiver/shovel/probe + guide off-piste; Samnaun (Swiss) side falls under SLF - check the correct national bulletin per side; heli-skiing NOT available here (Austria restricts to Vorarlberg sites); pace alcohol at altitude; rescue 140 Bergrettung","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/austria","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:12Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:19:06+01:00","source_country":"austria","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms — plus the opening (late Nov) + closing (late Apr/May) Top of the Mountain concert weekends","shoulder":"Early Dec + spring skiing (high snow-sure terrain to early May)","green":"May-Jun + Oct-Nov (primarily a winter resort — many lifts/hotels closed; verify)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + concert weekends 3-8 mo (Trofana + peak weeks earlier); regular winter 2-4 mo","off_season_specials":"Concert weekends as demand anchors; spring-ski value; Silvretta Therme shoulder wellness","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (late Nov-early May), Top of the Mountain concerts (opening + closing), Christmas/NY","fire_date":"Next winter + opening concert by Aug-Sep; closing concert + spring-ski from Jan; cross-border/duty-free novelty year-round"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski 239 km across two countries on one pass","si_